SUMMARY:Montreat from Lookout parking to Rainbow Ridge to East Ridge to Tr
 estle Trail
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Mountains-to-Sea Trail Hiking Club 2.0\nWe'll be doi
 ng a different route than I usually do\, but Tracy has done it and given d
 irections: From trailhed\, Rainbow Rod to Old Mitchell Toll Rd. to Hickory
  Ridge Trail which will take us to Lookout Mtn and to E. Ridge trail. We'l
 l come back via Eastridge Trail to Buck Gap and Old Trestle Trail. It's ab
 out 5.3 to 5.5 miles. 1100 feet elevation gain. It will probably take us a
  little over 2 hours. We don't typically stop except for a mid-point water
  break.\n\nMeet at the Lookout parking lot/Trailhead in Montreat.
